{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"calc2-lesson02","version":1,"title":"微分積分学続論II","subtitle":"第2回 · 同次形・完全形と線積分","scope":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf、全17物理ページ。同次形・完全形と線積分。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期木３]微分積分学続論II/授業資料/微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","sha256":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c","pageCount":17,"reviewedPages":[1,4,5,10,15],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"calc2-l02-q01","version":1,"prompt":"同次形の微分方程式\\(y'=F(y/x)\\)を、x≠0の区間で変数分離形に直す置換は？","answer":"\\(z=y/x\\)、すなわちy=xzと置く。","criterion":"y/xを新しい未知関数にすると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","page":1,"imageKey":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:1"}],"promptHtml":"同次形の微分方程式<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=F(y/x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>を、x≠0の区間で変数分離形に直す置換は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=y/x</annotation></semantics></math></span>、すなわちy=xzと置く。","criterionHtml":"y/xを新しい未知関数にすると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l02-q02","version":1,"prompt":"x≠0の区間で\\(y'=F(y/x)\\)にy=xzを代入した。zが満たす方程式は？","answer":"\\(xz'=F(z)-z\\)。","criterion":"y′=z+xz′を用いた式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","page":1,"imageKey":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:1"}],"promptHtml":"x≠0の区間で<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=F(y/x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>にy=xzを代入した。zが満たす方程式は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xz&#x27;=F(z)-z</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"y′=z+xz′を用いた式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l02-q03","version":1,"prompt":"単連結な開領域でP,QはC¹級とする。\\(P\\,dx+Q\\,dy=0\\)が完全形となる判定条件は？","answer":"\\(P_y=Q_x\\)。","criterion":"交差する偏微分の一致と言えれば正解。","explanation":"単連結とは、領域内の閉曲線を領域内で連続的に一点へ縮められること。","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","page":5,"imageKey":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:5"}],"promptHtml":"単連結な開領域でP,QはC¹級とする。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\,dx+Q\\,dy=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>が完全形となる判定条件は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_y=Q_x</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"交差する偏微分の一致と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":"単連結とは、領域内の閉曲線を領域内で連続的に一点へ縮められること。"},{"id":"calc2-l02-q04","version":1,"prompt":"\\(P\\,dx+Q\\,dy=0\\)が完全形で、fx=P、fy=Qを満たすfが得られた。解を陰的にどう表す？","answer":"\\(f(x,y)=C\\)。","criterion":"fが一定という関係と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","page":4,"imageKey":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:4"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\,dx+Q\\,dy=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>が完全形で、fx=P、fy=Qを満たすfが得られた。解を陰的にどう表す？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x,y)=C</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"fが一定という関係と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l02-q05","version":1,"prompt":"曲線γを\\(\\mathbf r(t)=(x(t),y(t))\\)、a≤t≤bで表す。スカラー関数fの線積分\\(\\int_\\gamma f\\,ds\\)をtの積分に直すと？","answer":"\\(\\int_a^b f(x(t),y(t))\\sqrt{x'(t)^2+y'(t)^2}\\,dt\\)。","criterion":"速さの因子を掛けた積分を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:10"}],"promptHtml":"曲線γを<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf r(t)=(x(t),y(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span>、a≤t≤bで表す。スカラー関数fの線積分<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>γ</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_\\gamma f\\,ds</annotation></semantics></math></span>をtの積分に直すと？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_a^b f(x(t),y(t))\\sqrt{x&#x27;(t)^2+y&#x27;(t)^2}\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"速さの因子を掛けた積分を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l02-q06","version":1,"prompt":"曲線γを(x(t),y(t))、a≤t≤bで表す。\\(\\int_\\gamma P\\,dx+Q\\,dy\\)をtの積分に直すと？","answer":"\\(\\int_a^b[P(x(t),y(t))x'(t)+Q(x(t),y(t))y'(t)]\\,dt\\)。","criterion":"各成分に対応する座標の微分を掛けて足せれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","page":15,"imageKey":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:15"}],"promptHtml":"曲線γを(x(t),y(t))、a≤t≤bで表す。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>γ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_\\gamma P\\,dx+Q\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span>をtの積分に直すと？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_a^b[P(x(t),y(t))x&#x27;(t)+Q(x(t),y(t))y&#x27;(t)]\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"各成分に対応する座標の微分を掛けて足せれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"calc2-l02-q07","version":1,"prompt":"平面領域Dの境界を正の向きに1周する。P,QはDの近傍でC¹級とする。グリーンの定理は？","answer":"\\(\\oint_{\\partial D}(P\\,dx+Q\\,dy)=\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)\\,dx\\,dy\\)。","criterion":"偏微分の差の順序を含めて言えれば正解。","explanation":"正の向きは、進行方向の左側にDがある向き。境界は区分的になめらかとする。","sources":[{"file":"微分積分学続論II 2.pdf","page":15,"imageKey":"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:15"}],"promptHtml":"平面領域Dの境界を正の向きに1周する。P,QはDの近傍でC¹級とする。グリーンの定理は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∮</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint_{\\partial D}(P\\,dx+Q\\,dy)=\\iint_D(Q_x-P_y)\\,dx\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"偏微分の差の順序を含めて言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":"正の向きは、進行方向の左側にDがある向き。境界は区分的になめらかとする。"}],"sourceImages":{"622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:1":"./assets/sources/622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c-1.png","622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:5":"./assets/sources/622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c-5.png","622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:4":"./assets/sources/622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c-4.png","622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:10":"./assets/sources/622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c-10.png","622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c:15":"./assets/sources/622fc7211d290c438baa01852c67716cd404b3da37b74c3779b3b5283cee9e5c-15.png"},"renderVersion":1}